			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.peterjanes.ca/@me\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>me</span></a></span> that’s a fair question!</p><p>Given this campaign and previous campaigns, in the Awesome org internally we know how successful it *could* be if the mailing list were operating as expected and we just want the opportunity to reach that full potential!</p>",
